{
  "_about": "Contrast pairs: every text-on-background and UI-part-on-background pairing the shells draw, by surface, checked for every theme by scripts/theme-contrast (tokens.json's values, in just lint) and by apps/macos/automation/e2e/contrast.sh (the colours the running app resolves, system colours and the user's accent included). docs/themes.md, \"Contrast\", explains the rules.",
  "version": 1,
  "reference": "atom-one-dark",
  "_kinds": "WCAG minimum per kind. text: body text. secondary: secondary, muted or bold text. ui: icons, status marks, focus indicators, cursors (WCAG 1.4.11). faint: fills and hairlines that only need to stay as visible as in the reference (no WCAG minimum).",
  "kinds": {
    "text": 4.5,
    "secondary": 3.0,
    "ui": 3.0,
    "faint": 1.0
  },
  "_relative": "Every pair must keep at least `relative` of the reference theme's contrast for the same pair, counted as ratio - 1 (1:1 is no contrast), up to `cap` for its kind: a pair the reference draws at 12:1 needs 7:1, not 8.7:1.",
  "relative": 0.7,
  "cap": {
    "text": 7.0,
    "secondary": 4.5,
    "ui": 3.5,
    "faint": 21.0
  },
  "_layers": "fg is one layer, bg a stack listed top first; each layer is composited over the ones under it (source over, in sRGB), and the bottom one is drawn on `window`. A layer is a colour token, `term.<key>` (the terminal palette: background, foreground, cursor, cursorText, selectionBackground, selectionForeground, 0-15), `sys.<NSColor name>` (a system colour no token covers; `system` below has its default per appearance) or `sample.<name>` (a backdrop the e2e samples from the app's capture, `system` again for the default). `@a` replaces the layer's alpha (withAlphaComponent), `*a` multiplies it (a view's alphaValue). dim: the pair as an unfocused tile shows it, color.dimFill at alpha.unfocusedDim over fg and bg alike. light/dark: the kind in themes of that appearance (`skip`: not checked there); the relative rule only applies where the theme's kind is the reference's.",
  "system": {
    "labelColor": {"light": "#000000d8", "dark": "#ffffffd8"},
    "sample.palette": {"light": "#e6e7e7", "dark": "#1f2020"},
    "sample.sidebar": {"light": "#e5e6e6", "dark": "#272828"}
  },
  "pairs": [
